{
  "name": "Log n8n workflow failures to Google Sheets and alert on Telegram (lead qualification companion)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "0ce3cf95-7ab9-42af-b3a8-2cf78fc9240e",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -608,
        -208
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## Log n8n workflow failures to Google Sheets and alert on Telegram (lead qualification companion)\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow acts as an error handler for another n8n workflow, capturing failures as soon as they occur. It builds a structured error record, appends it to Google Sheets for audit/history, then sends Telegram notifications. A secondary alert path is positioned below the main notification path to report issues related to logging or sheet availability.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure this workflow as the error workflow for the relevant n8n workflow, such as the lead qualification companion workflow.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and select the spreadsheet and sheet where error rows should be appended.\n- Configure Telegram bot credentials and the target chat ID for both Telegram alert nodes.\n- Review the fields created in the error record so they match the columns in the Google Sheet, including template, correlation_id, status, and stage.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the Set node fields and the two Code nodes to include additional context such as workflow name, execution URL, lead ID, or severity. You can also customize the Telegram message format or route the sheet-down alert to a different chat."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "8d88d824-2005-4b3b-880a-fc918417ce3d",
