      "name": "Send Failure Alert to Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "notes": "Fires for production executions that escape per-node error handling, after the Error Log row is written. Reads the error record by node name. Telegram here; swap for Slack/Email if the client alerts elsewhere.",
      "maxTries": 3,
      "position": [
        944,
        0
