      "name": "Send Sheet Down Alert to Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "notes": "Same alert, taken when the Error Log append itself failed, so a broken sheet never swallows the failure. The message says the row is missing.",
      "maxTries": 3,
      "position": [
